<title>UK: EMI Group names HMV chief to board.</title>
<headline>EMI Group names HMV chief to board.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>EMI Group Plc said on Friday it named Stuart McAllister, chief executive of its HMV Group Ltd, as an executive director on its board, effective immediately.</p>
<p>McAllister, 49, joined Thorn EMI Plc in 1984 and was named chief executive of HMV in 1986.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
